    "Add Garmin Device to Trio. This happens via Garmin Connect. If you have multiple phones with Garmin Connect and the same Garmin device, you will run into connectivity issue between watch and phone depending of proximity of the phones, which might also affect your watchface function." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Add Garmin Device to Trio. This happens via Garmin Connect. If you have multiple phones with Garmin Connect and the same Garmin device, you will run into connectivity issue between watch and phone depending of proximity of the phones, which might also affect your watchface function."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Přidej zařízení Garmin do Tria. To probíhá přes Garmin Connect. Pokud máš víc telefonů s Garmin Connect a stejným zařízením Garmin, narazíš na problémy s připojením mezi hodinkami a telefonem (podle toho, jak blízko telefony jsou), což může ovlivnit i fungování ciferníku."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
