    "All glucose, insulin, and carb data. All therapy settings (basal, ISF, carb ratio, glucose targets). Your Nightscout URL and API token. Your Tidepool credentials. Remote-command secrets and APNS keys. Time zone. Location data. Logs are never sent automatically; sharing them remains a user-initiated flow." : {

    },
    "All insulin will be suspended if your glucose is predicted to drop below the safety threshold.\n\nMust be set between 60-120 mg/dL.\nTo convert from mmol/L, multiply by 18.\n\nNote: Basal may be resumed if there's negative IOB and glucose is rising faster than predicted." : {
      "comment" : "Minimum Safety Threshold",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Целият инсулин ще бъде спрян, ако се прогнозира глюкозата ви да падне под прага на безопасност.\n\nТрябва да бъде зададен между 60-120 mg/dL.\nЗа преобразуване от mmol/L, умножете по 18.\n\nЗабележка: Базалът може да бъде възобновен, ако IOB е отрицателен и глюкозата се повишава по-бързо от прогнозираното."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Veškerý inzulín bude pozastaven, pokud se předpovídá pokles glykémie pod bezpečnostní hranici.\n\nMusí být nastaveno mezi 60–120 mg/dL. \nPro převod z mmol/L vynásob 18.\n\nPoznámka: Bazál může být obnoven, pokud je IOB záporné a glykémie roste rychleji, než se předpokládalo."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Al insulin vil blive suspenderet, hvis dit blodsukker forventes at falde under sikkerhedstærsklen.\n\nSkal indstilles mellem 60-120 mg/dl.\nAt konvertere fra mmol/l, multiplicere med 18.\n\nBemærk: Basal kan genoptages, hvis der er negative IOB og glucose stiger hurtigere end forventet."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Insulinabgabe wird pausiert, wenn Dein Glukosewert voraussichtlich unter dem Sicherheitsschwellenwert fallen sollte.\n\nMuss zwischen 60-120 mg/dL eingestellt sein.\nUm zu mmol/L zu konvertieren, multipliziere den Wert mit 18.\n\nHinweis: Die Basalrate kann wieder fortgesetzt werden, wenn das IOB negativ ist und die Glukose schneller steigt als vorhergesagt."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All insulin will be suspended if your glucose is predicted to drop below the safety threshold.\n\nMust be set between 60-120 mg/dL.\nTo convert from mmol/L, multiply by 18.\n\nNote: Basal may be resumed if there's negative IOB and glucose is rising faster than predicted."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se suspenderá toda la insulina si se prevé que su glucosa caiga debajo del umbral de seguridad.\n\nDebe establecerse entre 60-120 mg/dL.\nPara convertir desde mmol/L, multiplicar por 18.\n\nNota: Basal puede reanudarse si hay IOB negativo y la glucosa está aumentando más rápido de lo previsto."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Toute administration d'insuline sera suspendue si l'évolution prévue du glucose indique une valeur en dessous de ce seuil de sécurité.\n\nDoit être définie entre 60 - 120 mg/dL.\nPour convertir des mmol/L en mg/dL, multipliez par 18.\n\nRemarque : Le débit basal peut reprendre si l'insuline active (IOB) est négative et que le glucose augmente plus rapidement que prévu."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "All insulin will be suspended if your glucose is predicted to drop below the safety threshold.\n\nMust be set between 60-120 mg/dL.\nTo convert from mmol/L, multiply by 18.\n\nNote: Basal may be resumed if there's negative IOB and glucose is rising faster than predicted."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tutte le insuline saranno sospese se si prevede che il glucosio scenda al di sotto della soglia di sicurezza.\n\nDeve essere fissato tra 60-120 mg/dL.\nPer convertire da mmol/L, moltiplicare per 18.\n\nNota: la basale può essere ripresa se c'è IOB negativo e il glucosio sta aumentando più velocemente del previsto."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "All insulin will be suspended if your glucose is predicted to drop below the safety threshold.\n\nMust be set between 60-120 mg/dL.\nTo convert from mmol/L, multiply by 18.\n\nNote: Basal may be resumed if there's negative IOB and glucose is rising faster than predicted."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Insulintilførsel vil bli suspendert hvis blodsukkeret ditt er beregnet å synke under sikkerhetsterskelen.\n\nMå settes mellom 60-120 mg/dL.\nFor å konvertere fra mmol/L, multipliser med 18.\n\nMerk: Basal kan gjenopptas hvis det er negativ IOB og blodsukkeret stiger raskere enn anslått."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alle insuline wordt geschorst als je glucose lager uitvalt dan de veiligheidsdrempel.\n\nMoet worden ingesteld tussen 60 en 120 mg/dL.\nOm te converteren vanaf mmol/L, vermenigvuldigen met 18.\n\nOpmerking: Basaal kan worden hervat als er negatieve IOB is en glucose sneller stijgt dan voorspeld."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Podawanie insuliny zostanie zawieszone, jeśli przewiduje się, że stężenie glikemii spadnie poniżej progu bezpieczeństwa.\n\nMusi być ustawione pomiędzy 60-120 mg/dl.\nAby przekonwertować z mmol/l, pomnożyć przez 18.\n\nUwaga: Dawka bazowa może zostać wznowiona, jeśli wartość IOB jest ujemna, a stężenie glikemii rośnie szybciej niż przewidywano."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "All insulin will be suspended if your glucose is predicted to drop below the safety threshold.\n\nMust be set between 60-120 mg/dL.\nTo convert from mmol/L, multiply by 18.\n\nNote: Basal may be resumed if there's negative IOB and glucose is rising faster than predicted."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "All insulin will be suspended if your glucose is predicted to drop below the safety threshold.\n\nMust be set between 60-120 mg/dL.\nTo convert from mmol/L, multiply by 18.\n\nNote: Basal may be resumed if there's negative IOB and glucose is rising faster than predicted."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "All insulin will be suspended if your glucose is predicted to drop below the safety threshold.\n\nMust be set between 60-120 mg/dL.\nTo convert from mmol/L, multiply by 18.\n\nNote: Basal may be resumed if there's negative IOB and glucose is rising faster than predicted."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Allt insulin kommer att stängas av om ditt glukosvärde beräknas sjunka under säkerhetströskeln.\n\nMåste sättas mellan 60-120 mg/dL.\nAtt konvertera från mmol/L, multiplicera med 18.\n\nObs: Basal kan återupptas om det finns negativ IOB och glukos stiger snabbare än väntat."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "All insulin will be suspended if your glucose is predicted to drop below the safety threshold.\n\nMust be set between 60-120 mg/dL.\nTo convert from mmol/L, multiply by 18.\n\nNote: Basal may be resumed if there's negative IOB and glucose is rising faster than predicted."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "All insulin will be suspended if your glucose is predicted to drop below the safety threshold.\n\nMust be set between 60-120 mg/dL.\nTo convert from mmol/L, multiply by 18.\n\nNote: Basal may be resumed if there's negative IOB and glucose is rising faster than predicted."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tất cả insulin sẽ bị tạm ngưng nếu mức đường huyết của bạn được dự đoán sẽ giảm xuống dưới ngưỡng an toàn.\n\nPhải được đặt trong khoảng từ 60–120 mg/dL.\nĐể chuyển đổi từ mmol/L, hãy nhân với 18.\n\nLưu ý: Insulin nền có thể được tiếp tục nếu có IOB âm và đường huyết đang tăng nhanh hơn so với dự đoán.."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果預測您的血糖將下降到安全門檻值以下，則所有胰島素將被暫停。\n\n必須設定在 60-120 mg/dL 之間。\n如需從 mmol/L 轉換，請乘以 18。\n\n注意：如果有負的 IOB 而且血糖上升速度快於預測，則可以恢復基礎。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
