    "Allows fat and protein to be converted into future carb equivalents using the Warsaw formula of kilocalories divided by 10.\n\nThis spreads the carb equivilants over a maximum duration setting that can be configured from 5-12 hours.\n\nDelay is time from now until the first future carb entry.\n\nInterval in minutes is how many minutes are between entries. The shorter the interval, the smoother the result. 10, 15, 20, 30, or 60 are reasonable choices.\n\nAdjustment factor is how much effect the fat and protein has on the entries. 1.0 is full effect (original Warsaw Method) and 0.5 is half effect. Note that you may find that your normal carb ratio needs to increase to a larger number if you begin adding fat and protein entries. For this reason, it is best to start with a factor of about 0.5 to ease into it.\n\nDefault settings: Time Cap: 8 h, Interval: 30 min, Factor: 0.5, Delay 60 min" : {
      "comment" : "Description",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Позволява мазнините и протеините да бъдат преобразувани в бъдещи еквиваленти на въглехидрати чрез Варшавския метод (килокалории, разделени на 10).\n\nТова разпределя еквивалентите на въглехидрати в рамките на максимална продължителност, която може да се конфигурира от 5 до 12 часа.\n\nЗакъснението е времето от сега до първия бъдещ запис на въглехидрати.\n\nИнтервалът в минути е броят минути между записите. Колкото по-кратък е интервалът, толкова по-плавен е резултатът. Разумни избори са 10, 15, 20, 30 или 60.\n\nФакторът на регулиране определя колко ефект оказват мазнините и протеините върху записите. 1.0 е пълен ефект (оригинален Варшавски метод), а 0.5 е половин ефект. Обърнете внимание, че може да се наложи обичайното ви въглехидратно число да се увеличи, ако започнете да добавяте записи за мазнини и протеини. По тази причина е най-добре да започнете с фактор около 0.5.\n\nНастройки по подразбиране: Лимит на времето: 8 ч, Интервал: 30 мин, Фактор: 0.5, Закъснение: 60 мин"
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Umožňuje převod tuků a bílkovin na budoucí sacharidové ekvivalenty pomocí Varšavské metody (počet kilokalorií děleno 10).\n\nTím se sacharidové ekvivalenty rozloží do maximální délky trvání, kterou lze nastavit v rozmezí 5–12 hodin.\n\nZpoždění je čas od této chvíle do prvního budoucího záznamu sacharidů.\n\nInterval v minutách udává dobu mezi jednotlivými záznamy. Čím kratší je interval, tím hladší je výsledek. Rozumnou volbou je 10, 15, 20, 30 nebo 60 minut.\n\nFaktor úpravy určuje, jak velký vliv mají tuky a bílkoviny na záznamy. Hodnota 1,0 znamená plný účinek (původní Varšavská metoda), 0,5 je poloviční účinek. Můžeš zjistit, že tvůj běžný sacharidový poměr bude nutné zvýšit, pokud začneš zadávat tuky a bílkoviny. Proto je nejlepší začít s faktorem kolem 0,5, abys mohl začít postupně.\n\nVýchozí nastavení: Časový limit: 8 h, Interval: 30 min, Faktor: 0,5, Zpoždění: 60 min."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gør det muligt at omdanne fedt og protein til fremtidige kulhydrater ved hjælp af Warszawa-formlen af kilokalorier divideret med 10.\n\nDette spreder carb equivilants over en maksimal varighed indstilling, der kan konfigureres fra 5-12 timer.\n\nForsinkelse er tid fra nu og indtil den første fremtidige carb post.\n\nInterval i minutter er, hvor mange minutter er mellem poster. Jo kortere interval, den glattere resultatet. 10, 15, 20, 30 eller 60 er rimelige valg.\n\nJusteringsfaktor er, hvor meget effekt fedt og protein har på indgangene. 1.0 er fuld effekt (oprindelige Warszawa Metode) og 0. er halv effekt. Bemærk, at du kan opdage, at din normale carb ratio skal stige til et større antal, hvis du begynder at tilføje fedt og protein poster. Derfor er det bedst at starte med en faktor på omkring 0,5 for at lette ind i det.\n\nStandardindstillinger: Time Cap: 8 h, Interval: 30 min, Factor: 0.5, Forsinkelse 60 min"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ermöglicht die Umwandlung von Fett und Eiweiß in zukünftige Kohlenhydratäquivalente unter Verwendung der Warschauer Formel (Kilokalorien geteilt durch 10). \n\nDies verteilt die Kohlenhydratäquivalente über eine 'maximale Dauer', die von 5-12 Stunden eingestellt werden kann.\n\n'Verzögerung' ist die Zeit von jetzt bis zum ersten zukünftigen Kohlenhydrateintrag.\n\n'Intervall' in Minuten gibt an, wie viele Minuten zwischen den Einträgen liegen. Je kürzer das Intervall, desto gleichmäßiger das Ergebnis. 10, 15, 20, 30 oder 60 Minuten sind eine gute Wahl.\n\nDer 'Anpassungsfaktor' gibt an, wie stark sich Fett und Eiweiß auf die Einträge auswirken. 1,0 entspricht der vollen Wirkung (ursprüngliche Warschauer Methode) und 0,5 der halben Wirkung. Beachte, dass Dein normales Kohlenhydrat:Insulin-Verhältnis möglicherweise auf eine höhere Zahl ansteigen muss, wenn Du beginnst, Fett- und Eiweißeinträge hinzuzufügen. Aus diesem Grund ist es am besten, mit einem Faktor von etwa 0,5 zu beginnen, um den Einstieg zu erleichtern.\n\nStandardeinstellungen: Maximale Dauer: 8 h, Verzögerung: 60 min, Intervall: 30 min, Anpassungsfaktor: 0,5"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Allows fat and protein to be converted into future carb equivalents using the Warsaw formula of kilocalories divided by 10.\n\nThis spreads the carb equivilants over a maximum duration setting that can be configured from 5-12 hours.\n\nDelay is time from now until the first future carb entry.\n\nInterval in minutes is how many minutes are between entries. The shorter the interval, the smoother the result. 10, 15, 20, 30, or 60 are reasonable choices.\n\nAdjustment factor is how much effect the fat and protein has on the entries. 1.0 is full effect (original Warsaw Method) and 0.5 is half effect. Note that you may find that your normal carb ratio needs to increase to a larger number if you begin adding fat and protein entries. For this reason, it is best to start with a factor of about 0.5 to ease into it.\n\nDefault settings: Time Cap: 8 h, Interval: 30 min, Factor: 0.5, Delay 60 min"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Allows fat and protein to be converted into future carb equivalents using the Warsaw formula of kilocalories divided by 10.\n\nThis spreads the carb equivilants over a maximum duration setting that can be configured from 5-12 hours.\n\nDelay is time from now until the first future carb entry.\n\nInterval in minutes is how many minutes are between entries. The shorter the interval, the smoother the result. 10, 15, 20, 30, or 60 are reasonable choices.\n\nAdjustment factor is how much effect the fat and protein has on the entries. 1.0 is full effect (original Warsaw Method) and 0.5 is half effect. Note that you may find that your normal carb ratio needs to increase to a larger number if you begin adding fat and protein entries. For this reason, it is best to start with a factor of about 0.5 to ease into it.\n\nDefault settings: Time Cap: 8 h, Interval: 30 min, Factor: 0.5, Delay 60 min"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Transforme les lipides et les protéines en équivalents glucidiques répartis dans le temps selon la formule de Warsaw, qui divise les kilocalories par 10.\n\nCette conversion répartit les équivalents glucidiques sur une durée maximale configurable entre 5 et 12 heures.\n\nDélai est le temps écoulé entre l'ajout de lipides et/ou protéines et la première entrée d'équivalents glucidiques futurs.\n\nIntervalle (en minutes) est le temps entre chaque entrée. Plus l’intervalle est court, plus le résultat est fluide. Les valeurs de 10, 15, 20, 30 ou 60 minutes sont des choix raisonnables.\n\nFacteur d'ajustement détermine l’impact des lipides et des protéines sur la conversion en équivalents glucidiques. 1,0 correspond à l'effet total (méthode originale de Varsaw), tandis que 0,5 représente un effet réduit de moitié. À noter que l'ajout de lipides et de protéines peut nécessiter une augmentation du Ratio Insuline/Glucides (plus grand nombre). Il est recommandé de commencer avec un facteur de 0,5 pour une transition progressive.\n\nParamètres par défaut : Durée maximale : 8 h, Intervalle : 30 min, Facteur d'ajustement : 0,5, Délai : 60 min"
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Allows fat and protein to be converted into future carb equivalents using the Warsaw formula of kilocalories divided by 10.\n\nThis spreads the carb equivilants over a maximum duration setting that can be configured from 5-12 hours.\n\nDelay is time from now until the first future carb entry.\n\nInterval in minutes is how many minutes are between entries. The shorter the interval, the smoother the result. 10, 15, 20, 30, or 60 are reasonable choices.\n\nAdjustment factor is how much effect the fat and protein has on the entries. 1.0 is full effect (original Warsaw Method) and 0.5 is half effect. Note that you may find that your normal carb ratio needs to increase to a larger number if you begin adding fat and protein entries. For this reason, it is best to start with a factor of about 0.5 to ease into it.\n\nDefault settings: Time Cap: 8 h, Interval: 30 min, Factor: 0.5, Delay 60 min"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Consenti di convertire grassi e proteine in futuri equivalenti di carboidrati utilizzando la formula di Varsavia di chilocalorie divisi per 10.\n\nQuesto diffonde gli equivilanti del carb per un'impostazione di durata massima che può essere configurata da 5-12 ore.\n\nIl ritardo è tempo da ora fino al primo ingresso futuro del carb.\n\nL'intervallo in pochi minuti è il numero di minuti tra le voci. Più breve è l'intervallo, più liscia il risultato. 10, 15, 20, 30 o 60 sono scelte ragionevoli.\n\nIl fattore di aggiustamento è il peso che il grasso e la proteina hanno sulle voci. 1.0 è effetto pieno (metodo di Varsavia originale) e 0. è a metà effetto. Nota che potresti scoprire che il tuo normale rapporto carboidrati deve aumentare ad un numero maggiore se inizi ad aggiungere voci di grasso e proteine. Per questo motivo, è meglio iniziare con un fattore di circa 0,5 per facilitare in esso.\n\nImpostazioni predefinite: Limite temporale: 8 h, Intervallo: 30 min, Fatto: 0.5, Ritardo 60 min"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Allows fat and protein to be converted into future carb equivalents using the Warsaw formula of kilocalories divided by 10.\n\nThis spreads the carb equivilants over a maximum duration setting that can be configured from 5-12 hours.\n\nDelay is time from now until the first future carb entry.\n\nInterval in minutes is how many minutes are between entries. The shorter the interval, the smoother the result. 10, 15, 20, 30, or 60 are reasonable choices.\n\nAdjustment factor is how much effect the fat and protein has on the entries. 1.0 is full effect (original Warsaw Method) and 0.5 is half effect. Note that you may find that your normal carb ratio needs to increase to a larger number if you begin adding fat and protein entries. For this reason, it is best to start with a factor of about 0.5 to ease into it.\n\nDefault settings: Time Cap: 8 h, Interval: 30 min, Factor: 0.5, Delay 60 min"
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bruker Warsaw-formelen til å konvertere fett og proteiner til fremtidige karbohydrat-ekvivalenter.\n\nDette fordeler karbohydrat-ekvivalentene over et antall timer som kan justeres mellom 5 og 12.\n\nForsinkelse er tiden fra nå til den første fremtidige karbohydrat-ekvivalenten blir lagt til.\n\nIntervall i minutter er antall minutter mellom hver registrering. Jo kortere intervall, jo jevnere blir resultatet. 10, 15, 20, 30 eller 60 er fornuftige valg.\n\nJusteringsfaktor er hvor stor effekt fett og proteiner har på registreringene. 1,0 er full effekt (original Warsaw-formel) og 0,5 er halv effekt. Merk at du kan ha behov for å justere opp din vanlige karbohydrat-ratio hvis du begynner å registrere fett og proteiner. På grunn av dette, anbefales det å starte med en faktor på rundt 0,5 for å starte forsiktig.\n\nStandardinnstilling: Maks varighet: 8 t, Intervall: 30 min, Faktor: 0,5, Forsinkelse: 60 min"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dit laat je vet en eiwit omzetten in toekomstige koolhydraten met behulp van de Warschau-formule. Deze formule verdeelt de koolhydraten over een zelf in te stellen tijdsduur van 5-12 uur.\n\nDe vertraging is de tijd tussen nu en de eerste toekomstige koolhydrateninvoer. Het interval in minuten is het aantal minuten tussen elke invoer. Als je een korter interval kiest, wordt het resultaat gelijkmatiger. Goede keuzes zijn bijvoorbeeld 10, 15, 20, 30 of 60 minuten.\n\nDe aanpassingsfactor bepaalt het effect van vet en eiwit op de waarden. Een factor van 1,0 betekent volledig effect (de oorspronkelijke Warschau-methode), en 0,5 betekent half effect.\n\nLet op dat je mogelijk moet opmerken dat je normale koolhydratenverhouding moet verhogen tot een hoger getal wanneer je vet en eiwit toevoegt. Daarom is het het beste om te beginnen met een factor van ongeveer 0,5 om het jezelf makkelijk te maken.\n\nStandaardinstellingen zijn een tijdslimiet van 8 uur, een interval van 30 minuten, een factor van 0,5 en een vertraging van 60 minuten"
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Umożliwia przekształcanie tłuszczu i białka na przyszłe ekwiwalenty węglowodanów przy użyciu wzoru warszawskiego na kilokalorie podzielonym przez 10.\n\nDzięki temu ekwiwalenty węglowodanów rozkładają się przez maksymalny czas trwania, który można skonfigurować w zakresie od 5 do 12 godzin.\n\nOpóźnienie to czas od teraz do pierwszego wprowadzenia węglowodanów w przyszłości.\n\nInterwał w minutach to liczba minut pomiędzy wpisami. Im krótszy interwał, tym gładszy wynik. 10, 15, 20, 30 lub 60 to rozsądne wybory.\n\nWspółczynnik dostosowania to wpływ tłuszczu i białka na wpisy. 1.0 to pełny efekt (oryginalna metoda warszawska) a 0,5 to połowa efektu. Należy pamiętać, że normalny stosunek węglowodanów może wzrosnąć do większej liczby, jeśli zacznie się dodawać tłuszcze i białka. Z tego powodu najlepiej zacząć od czynnika około 0,5 w celu jego złagodzenia.\n\nUstawienia domyślne: Limit czasu: 8 h, interwał: 30 min, współczynnik: 0,5, opóźnienie 60 min"
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Allows fat and protein to be converted into future carb equivalents using the Warsaw formula of kilocalories divided by 10.\n\nThis spreads the carb equivilants over a maximum duration setting that can be configured from 5-12 hours.\n\nDelay is time from now until the first future carb entry.\n\nInterval in minutes is how many minutes are between entries. The shorter the interval, the smoother the result. 10, 15, 20, 30, or 60 are reasonable choices.\n\nAdjustment factor is how much effect the fat and protein has on the entries. 1.0 is full effect (original Warsaw Method) and 0.5 is half effect. Note that you may find that your normal carb ratio needs to increase to a larger number if you begin adding fat and protein entries. For this reason, it is best to start with a factor of about 0.5 to ease into it.\n\nDefault settings: Time Cap: 8 h, Interval: 30 min, Factor: 0.5, Delay 60 min"
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Allows fat and protein to be converted into future carb equivalents using the Warsaw formula of kilocalories divided by 10.\n\nThis spreads the carb equivilants over a maximum duration setting that can be configured from 5-12 hours.\n\nDelay is time from now until the first future carb entry.\n\nInterval in minutes is how many minutes are between entries. The shorter the interval, the smoother the result. 10, 15, 20, 30, or 60 are reasonable choices.\n\nAdjustment factor is how much effect the fat and protein has on the entries. 1.0 is full effect (original Warsaw Method) and 0.5 is half effect. Note that you may find that your normal carb ratio needs to increase to a larger number if you begin adding fat and protein entries. For this reason, it is best to start with a factor of about 0.5 to ease into it.\n\nDefault settings: Time Cap: 8 h, Interval: 30 min, Factor: 0.5, Delay 60 min"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Позволяет преобразовывать жиры и белки в будущие эквиваленты углеводов, используя варшавскую формулу деления килокалорий на 10.\n\nЭто распределяет эквиваленты углеводов по максимальной продолжительности, которая может быть установлена в пределах 5-12 часов.\n\nЗадержка - это время с настоящего момента до первого ввода углеводов в будущем.\n\nИнтервал в минутах - это количество минут между записями. Чем короче интервал, тем более плавный результат. 10, 15, 20, 30 или 60 - разумный выбор.\n\nКорректирующий коэффициент - это то, насколько сильно жир и белок влияют на количество продуктов. 1.0 - это полный эффект (оригинальный Варшавский метод), а 0.5 - половинный эффект. Обратите внимание, что вы можете обнаружить, что ваше нормальное соотношение углеводов нуждается в увеличении, если вы начнете добавлять жиры и белки. По этой причине лучше всего начинать с коэффициента примерно 0.5, чтобы облегчить его использование.\n\nНастройки по умолчанию: Ограничение по времени: 8 часов, Интервал: 30 минут, Коэффициент: 0.5, Задержка 60 минут"
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Omvandlar fett och protein till kolhydratekvivalenter, enligt Warsawa-metoden: antal kilokalorier delat med 10.\n\nDetta sprider ut kolydraterna över ett framtida tidsintervall med maximal duration enligt inställningen för max tid, 5-12 timmar.\n\nIntervall i minuter bestämmer antalet minuter mellan kolhydratposterna. Ju kortare intervall, desto mer utjämnat resultat. 10, 15, 20, 30, or 60 är exempel på alternativ\n\nFördrjöjning är tiden från nu till första framtida kolhydratpost.\n\nJustering tillåter individuell inställning av faktorn. 1.0 betyder full effekt, 0.5 skapar halva mängden kolhydrater. Observera att om du alltid matar in fett och kolhydrater kan du behöva öka din insulinkvot. Av denna anledning kan det vara lämpligt att börja med 0.5.\n\nStandardinställningar: Max tid: 8 h, Intervall: 30 min, Faktor: 0.5, Fördröjning 60 min"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Allows fat and protein to be converted into future carb equivalents using the Warsaw formula of kilocalories divided by 10.\n\nThis spreads the carb equivilants over a maximum duration setting that can be configured from 5-12 hours.\n\nDelay is time from now until the first future carb entry.\n\nInterval in minutes is how many minutes are between entries. The shorter the interval, the smoother the result. 10, 15, 20, 30, or 60 are reasonable choices.\n\nAdjustment factor is how much effect the fat and protein has on the entries. 1.0 is full effect (original Warsaw Method) and 0.5 is half effect. Note that you may find that your normal carb ratio needs to increase to a larger number if you begin adding fat and protein entries. For this reason, it is best to start with a factor of about 0.5 to ease into it.\n\nDefault settings: Time Cap: 8 h, Interval: 30 min, Factor: 0.5, Delay 60 min"
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Дозволяє перетворювати жири та білки в майбутні еквіваленти вуглеводів, використовуючи варшавську формулу поділу кілокалорій на 10.\n\nЦе розподіляє еквіваленти вуглеводів за максимальною тривалістю, яка може бути встановлена в межах 5-12 годин. до першого введення вуглеводів у майбутньому.\n\nІнтервал у хвилинах - це кількість хвилин між записами. Чим коротший інтервал, тим паче плавний результат. 10, 15, 20, 30 або 60 - розумний вибір. Коригуючий коефіцієнт - це те, наскільки сильно жир і білок впливають на кількість продуктів. 1.0 – це повний ефект (оригінальний Варшавський метод), а 0.5 – половинний ефект. Зверніть увагу, що ви можете виявити, що ваше нормальне співвідношення вуглеводів потребує збільшення, якщо ви почнете додавати жири та білки. З цієї причини найкраще починати з коефіцієнта приблизно 0.5, щоб полегшити його використання."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cho phép chuyển đổi chất béo và protein thành lượng carb tương đương trong tương lai bằng cách sử dụng công thức Warsaw (lượng kilocalo chia cho 10).\n\nViệc chuyển đổi này sẽ phân bổ lượng carb tương đương đó theo thời gian tối đa do người dùng cấu hình, từ 5 đến 12 giờ.\n\nĐộ trễ là khoảng thời gian từ hiện tại đến khi ghi nhận carb đầu tiên trong tương lai.\n\nKhoảng thời gian (Interval) là số phút giữa các lần ghi nhận. Khoảng thời gian càng ngắn thì kết quả càng mượt mà. Các giá trị hợp lý: 10, 15, 20, 30 hoặc 60 phút.\n\nHệ số điều chỉnh (Adjustment factor) thể hiện mức ảnh hưởng của chất béo và chất đạm đến các mục carb.\n1.0 là ảnh hưởng đầy đủ (theo phương pháp Warsaw gốc) và 0.5 là ảnh hưởng một nửa. \nLưu ý: Bạn có thể sẽ cần điều chỉnh lại tỷ lệ carb thông thường (carb ratio) của mình thành số lớn hơn nếu bắt đầu thêm mục chất béo và chất đạm. Vì lý do này, nên bắt đầu với hệ số khoảng 0.5 để làm quen dần.\n\nThiết lập mặc định: Giới hạn thời gian: 8 giờ, Khoảng: 30 phút, Hệ số: 0.5, Trễ: 60 phút"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允許脂肪和蛋白質根據華沙公式轉換為未來的碳水化合物當量，該公式為千卡數除以 10。\n\n這會將碳水化合物當量分配至最多可調整的最長持續時間，該持續時間可以設置在 5-12 小時之間。\n\n延遲是現在到第一個未來碳水化合物輸入的時間。\n\n分鐘間隔是每次輸入之間的分鐘數。間隔越短，結果越平滑。10、15、20、30 或 60 分鐘都是合理的選擇。\n\n調整因子是脂肪和蛋白質對輸入的影響程度。1.0 為完全效果（原始華沙方法），0.5 為半效果。請注意，如果您開始添加脂肪和蛋白質的輸入，則可能需要將正常的碳水化合物比率提高到更大的數字。為此，最佳的做法是從約 0.5 的因子開始，以便逐步適應。\n\n預設設定：時間上限：8 小時，間隔：30 分鐘，因子：0.5，延遲 60 分鐘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
