    "Carb entries will be fully decayed by the number of hours specified as Max Meal Absorption Time. Meals that are high in fat and/or protein can have long lasting effects on glucose levels. To allow such late meal effects to be considered by the carb decay model, a longer Max Meal Absorption Time than the default 6 hours can be set." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Записите за въглехидрати ще бъдат напълно разградени след броя часове, зададен като Максимално време за абсорбция на хранене. Хранения с високо съдържание на мазнини и/или протеини могат да имат продължителен ефект върху нивата на глюкоза. За да бъдат отчетени такива късни ефекти от хранене в модела за разграждане на въглехидрати, може да се зададе Максимално време за абсорбция на хранене, по-дълго от стандартните 6 часа."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zadané sacharidy budou plně vstřebány po uplynutí počtu hodin specifikovaných jako Maximální doba vstřebávání jídla. Jídla s vysokým obsahem tuků a/nebo bílkovin mohou mít dlouhodobé účinky na hladinu glukózy. Aby model vstřebávání sacharidů mohl tyto pozdní účinky jídla zohlednit, lze nastavit delší Maximální dobu vstřebávání jídla než výchozích 6 hodin."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Carb entries will be fully decayed by the number of hours specified as Max Meal Absorption Time. Meals that are high in fat and/or protein can have long lasting effects on glucose levels. To allow such late meal effects to be considered by the carb decay model, a longer Max Meal Absorption Time than the default 6 hours can be set."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Carb entries will be fully decayed by the number of hours specified as Max Meal Absorption Time. Meals that are high in fat and/or protein can have long lasting effects on glucose levels. To allow such late meal effects to be considered by the carb decay model, a longer Max Meal Absorption Time than the default 6 hours can be set."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Carb entries will be fully decayed by the number of hours specified as Max Meal Absorption Time. Meals that are high in fat and/or protein can have long lasting effects on glucose levels. To allow such late meal effects to be considered by the carb decay model, a longer Max Meal Absorption Time than the default 6 hours can be set."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les saisies de glucides seront entièrement absorbées au terme du nombre d'heures défini dans « Durée maximale d'absorption des repas ». Les repas riches en lipides et/ou en protéines peuvent avoir des effets prolongés sur les valeurs de glucose. Pour permettre au modèle de décroissance des glucides de prendre en compte ces effets tardifs, une « Durée maximale d'absorption des repas » plus longue que la valeur par défaut de 6 heures peut être définie."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Carb entries will be fully decayed by the number of hours specified as Max Meal Absorption Time. Meals that are high in fat and/or protein can have long lasting effects on glucose levels. To allow such late meal effects to be considered by the carb decay model, a longer Max Meal Absorption Time than the default 6 hours can be set."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Carb entries will be fully decayed by the number of hours specified as Max Meal Absorption Time. Meals that are high in fat and/or protein can have long lasting effects on glucose levels. To allow such late meal effects to be considered by the carb decay model, a longer Max Meal Absorption Time than the default 6 hours can be set."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Carb entries will be fully decayed by the number of hours specified as Max Meal Absorption Time. Meals that are high in fat and/or protein can have long lasting effects on glucose levels. To allow such late meal effects to be considered by the carb decay model, a longer Max Meal Absorption Time than the default 6 hours can be set."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Karbohydrater vil bli fullstendig tatt opp etter antall timer spesifisert som \"Maks tid for opptak av måltid\". Måltider som inneholder mye fett og/eller protein kan ha langvarige effekter på blodsukkeret. For å tillate at slike sene måltidseffekter vurderes av karbohydratnedbrytningsmodellen, kan du sette en større \"Maks tid for opptak av måltid\" enn standard 6 timer."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Carb entries will be fully decayed by the number of hours specified as Max Meal Absorption Time. Meals that are high in fat and/or protein can have long lasting effects on glucose levels. To allow such late meal effects to be considered by the carb decay model, a longer Max Meal Absorption Time than the default 6 hours can be set."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wpisy węglowodanów zostaną całkowicie rozłożone przez liczbę godzin określoną jako maksymalny czas wchłaniania. Posiłki o dużej zawartości tłuszczu i (lub) białka mogą mieć długotrwały wpływ na poziom glikemii we krwi. Aby model rozkładu węglowodanów uwzględniał wpływ późnego posiłku w modelu rozpadu węglowodanów można ustawić dłuższy Maksymalny Czas Wchłaniania Posiłku niż domyślnie 6 godzin."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Carb entries will be fully decayed by the number of hours specified as Max Meal Absorption Time. Meals that are high in fat and/or protein can have long lasting effects on glucose levels. To allow such late meal effects to be considered by the carb decay model, a longer Max Meal Absorption Time than the default 6 hours can be set."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Carb entries will be fully decayed by the number of hours specified as Max Meal Absorption Time. Meals that are high in fat and/or protein can have long lasting effects on glucose levels. To allow such late meal effects to be considered by the carb decay model, a longer Max Meal Absorption Time than the default 6 hours can be set."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Carb entries will be fully decayed by the number of hours specified as Max Meal Absorption Time. Meals that are high in fat and/or protein can have long lasting effects on glucose levels. To allow such late meal effects to be considered by the carb decay model, a longer Max Meal Absorption Time than the default 6 hours can be set."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Carb entries will be fully decayed by the number of hours specified as Max Meal Absorption Time. Meals that are high in fat and/or protein can have long lasting effects on glucose levels. To allow such late meal effects to be considered by the carb decay model, a longer Max Meal Absorption Time than the default 6 hours can be set."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Carb entries will be fully decayed by the number of hours specified as Max Meal Absorption Time. Meals that are high in fat and/or protein can have long lasting effects on glucose levels. To allow such late meal effects to be considered by the carb decay model, a longer Max Meal Absorption Time than the default 6 hours can be set."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Carb entries will be fully decayed by the number of hours specified as Max Meal Absorption Time. Meals that are high in fat and/or protein can have long lasting effects on glucose levels. To allow such late meal effects to be considered by the carb decay model, a longer Max Meal Absorption Time than the default 6 hours can be set."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Các mục nhập carbohydrate (carb) sẽ được xem là đã hấp thụ hoàn toàn sau số giờ được chỉ định trong mục Thời gian hấp thu bữa ăn tối đa (Max Meal Absorption Time). Các bữa ăn giàu chất béo và/hoặc chất đạm có thể ảnh hưởng đến mức đường huyết trong thời gian dài. Để hệ thống tính đến những ảnh hưởng muộn này của bữa ăn, bạn có thể đặt Thời gian hấp thu bữa ăn tối đa dài hơn giá trị mặc định là 6 giờ."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "碳水化合物輸入會在「最大餐點吸收時間」所指定的小時數內完全衰減。高脂肪和/或高蛋白的餐點可能對血糖有長時間影響。為了讓碳水衰減模型也能考量這些延遲的餐點影響，可以將最大餐點吸收時間設為比預設的 6 小時更長。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
