    "Choose which format you'd prefer the eA1c (estimated A1c) and GMI (Glucose Management Index) value in the statistics view as a percentage (Example: eA1c: 6.5%) or mmol/mol (Example: eA1c: 48 mmol/mol)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
