    "Furthermore, you could adjust that sensitivity change independently from the Half Basal Exercise Target specified in Algorithm > Target Behavior settings by deliberately setting a customized Insulin Percentage for a Temp Target." : {
      "comment" : "A paragraph explaining how to set a custom insulin percentage for a temporary target.",
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Освен това можете да регулирате тази промяна в чувствителността независимо от Half Basal Exercise Target, зададен в настройките Алгоритъм > Поведение на целта, като съзнателно зададете персонализиран процент на инсулина за временна цел."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kromě toho můžeš tuhle změnu citlivosti upravit nezávisle na cíli „Poloviční bazál při cvičení“ (nastaveném v sekci Algoritmus > Chování cíle), a to záměrným nastavením vlastního procenta inzulínu pro dočasný cíl."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Furthermore, you could adjust that sensitivity change independently from the Half Basal Exercise Target specified in Algorithm > Target Behavior settings by deliberately setting a customized Insulin Percentage for a Temp Target."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Furthermore, you could adjust that sensitivity change independently from the Half Basal Exercise Target specified in Algorithm > Target Behavior settings by deliberately setting a customized Insulin Percentage for a Temp Target."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Furthermore, you could adjust that sensitivity change independently from the Half Basal Exercise Target specified in Algorithm > Target Behavior settings by deliberately setting a customized Insulin Percentage for a Temp Target."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Par ailleurs, vous pouvez ajuster ce changement de sensibilité indépendamment de la \"Cible à demi-basal\" spécifiée dans « ⚙️ Réglages > Algorithme > Comportement cible », en définissant volontairement un pourcentage d’insuline personnalisé (\"Custom\") pour une Cible Temporaire."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Furthermore, you could adjust that sensitivity change independently from the Half Basal Exercise Target specified in Algorithm > Target Behavior settings by deliberately setting a customized Insulin Percentage for a Temp Target."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Furthermore, you could adjust that sensitivity change independently from the Half Basal Exercise Target specified in Algorithm > Target Behavior settings by deliberately setting a customized Insulin Percentage for a Temp Target."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Furthermore, you could adjust that sensitivity change independently from the Half Basal Exercise Target specified in Algorithm > Target Behavior settings by deliberately setting a customized Insulin Percentage for a Temp Target."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Videre kan du justere denne følsomhetsendringen uavhengig av halvbasal-treningsmålet som er angitt i innstillingene Algoritme > Innstillinger for mål ved å bevisst angi en tilpasset insulinprosent for et midlertidig mål."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Furthermore, you could adjust that sensitivity change independently from the Half Basal Exercise Target specified in Algorithm > Target Behavior settings by deliberately setting a customized Insulin Percentage for a Temp Target."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Co więcej, możesz dostosować tę zmianę wrażliwości niezależnie od Trybu Ćwiczeń określonego w ustawieniach Algorytm & Zachowanie Celu, ustawiając niestandardowy procent insuliny dla Celu Tymczasowego."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
