    "Important: Autosens Min and Autosens Max do not affect Temp Targets in the same way. Autosens Max limits how much insulin can be increased, but Autosens Min does not remove the 15% minimum when insulin is reduced." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Важно: Autosens Min и Autosens Max не влияят по един и същ начин на временните цели. Autosens Max ограничава с колко може да се увеличи инсулинът, но Autosens Min не премахва минималните 15% при намаляване на инсулина."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Důležité: Autosens Min a Autosens Max neovlivňují dočasné cíle stejným způsobem. Autosens Max omezuje, o kolik lze inzulín zvýšit, ale Autosens Min neruší 15% minimum při snižování inzulínu."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Important: Autosens Min and Autosens Max do not affect Temp Targets in the same way. Autosens Max limits how much insulin can be increased, but Autosens Min does not remove the 15% minimum when insulin is reduced."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wichtig: Autosens Min und Autosens Max beeinflussen Temporäre Ziele nicht auf die gleiche Weise. Autosens Max limitiert, wie viel Insulin erhöht werden kann, aber Autosens Min entfernt nicht das Minimum von 15%, wenn Insulin reduziert wird."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Important: Autosens Min and Autosens Max do not affect Temp Targets in the same way. Autosens Max limits how much insulin can be increased, but Autosens Min does not remove the 15% minimum when insulin is reduced."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Important : Les paramètres « Autosens min. » et « Autosens max. » n'affectent pas les cibles temporaires de la même manière. « Autosens max. » limite l'augmentation possible de l'insuline, mais « Autosens min. » ne supprime pas le minimum de 15 % lors d'une réduction d'insuline."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Important: Autosens Min and Autosens Max do not affect Temp Targets in the same way. Autosens Max limits how much insulin can be increased, but Autosens Min does not remove the 15% minimum when insulin is reduced."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Important: Autosens Min and Autosens Max do not affect Temp Targets in the same way. Autosens Max limits how much insulin can be increased, but Autosens Min does not remove the 15% minimum when insulin is reduced."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Important: Autosens Min and Autosens Max do not affect Temp Targets in the same way. Autosens Max limits how much insulin can be increased, but Autosens Min does not remove the 15% minimum when insulin is reduced."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Viktig: Autosens Min og Autosens Max påvirker ikke midlertidige mål på samme måte. Autosens Max begrenser hvor mye insulin kan økes, men Autosens Min fjerner ikke minimumsnivået på 15 % når insulinet reduseres."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Important: Autosens Min and Autosens Max do not affect Temp Targets in the same way. Autosens Max limits how much insulin can be increased, but Autosens Min does not remove the 15% minimum when insulin is reduced."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ważne: Autosens Min i Autosens Max nie wpływają w ten sam sposób na cele tymczasowe. Autosens Max ogranicza, ile insuliny może być zwiększone, ale Autosens Min nie usuwa minimum 15% gdy insulina jest zmniejszona."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Important: Autosens Min and Autosens Max do not affect Temp Targets in the same way. Autosens Max limits how much insulin can be increased, but Autosens Min does not remove the 15% minimum when insulin is reduced."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
