            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Maximum allowed positive percent change in glucose level to permit SMBs. If the difference in glucose is greater than this, Trio will only adjust Temp Basal Rate and not deliver an SMB that loop cycle."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maksimal tillatt positiv prosentvis endring i blodsukker for å tillate SMB. Hvis forskjellen i blodsukker er større enn dette, vil Trio bare justere midlertidig basalrate og ikke levere en SMB i denne loop-syklusen."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Maximum allowed positive percent change in glucose level to permit SMBs. If the difference in glucose is greater than this, Trio will only adjust Temp Basal Rate and not deliver an SMB that loop cycle."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maksymalna dozwolona dodatnia zmiana procentowa poziomu glikemii, aby umożliwić SMB. Jeśli różnica w poziomie glukozy jest większa Trio dostosuje tylko Bazę tymczasową i nie dostarczy SMB w danym cyklu pętli."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
