    "Note: Basal may be resumed if there is negative IOB and glucose is rising faster than the forecast." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Забележка: Базалът може да бъде възобновен, ако има отрицателно IOB и глюкозата се повишава по-бързо от прогнозата."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poznámka: Bazál může být obnoven, pokud je aktivní inzulín (IOB) záporný a glykémie roste rychleji, než se předpovídalo."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bemærk: Basal kan genoptages, hvis der er negativ IOB og glucose stiger hurtigere end forventet."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hinweis: Die Basalrate kann wieder aufgenommen werden, wenn der IOB negativ ist und die Glukose schneller ansteigt als prognostiziert."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nota: La basal se puede reanudar si existe un IOB negativo y la glucosa está aumentando más rápido que la predicción."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Remarque : Le débit basal peut reprendre s’il y a un IOB (insuline active) négatif et que la mesure de glucose augmente plus rapidement que prévu."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Note: Basal may be resumed if there is negative IOB and glucose is rising faster than the forecast."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nota: La basale può essere ripresa se vi è un IOB negativo e il glucosio sta aumentando più velocemente del previsto."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Note: Basal may be resumed if there is negative IOB and glucose is rising faster than the forecast."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Merk: Basal kan gjenopptas dersom det er negativ IOB og blodsukkeret stiger raskere enn prognosene."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Opmerking: Basaal kan worden hervat als er negatieve IOB is en glucose sneller stijgt dan de voorspelling."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uwaga: Dawka bazowa może zostać wznowiona w przypadku ujemnej wartości IOB, a stężenie glikemii rośnie szybciej niż prognozowano."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nota: Basal pode ser retomada se houver IOB negativa e a glicose está aumentando mais rápido do que a previsão."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Note: Basal may be resumed if there is negative IOB and glucose is rising faster than the forecast."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Примечание: Базаль может быть возобновлен, если существует отрицательная IOB и глюкоза растет быстрее, чем прогноз."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Obs: Basal kan återupptas om det finns negativ IOB och glukos stiger snabbare än prognosen."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Note: Basal may be resumed if there is negative IOB and glucose is rising faster than the forecast."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Примітка: Базал може бути відновлений, якщо є негативний заряд IOB та глюкоза зростають швидше за прогноз."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lưu ý: Truyền insulin nền có thể được tiếp tục nếu IOB âm và đường huyết đang tăng nhanh hơn so với dự đoán."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "注意：如果有負的 IOB 且血糖上升速度快於預測，則可能恢復基礎。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Note: Choosing your pump model determines which increments for setting up your basal rates are available. You will pair your actual pump after finishing the onboarding process." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Забележка: Избраният модел помпа определя какви стъпки за настройка на базалните дози са налични. Ще сдвоите действителната си помпа след приключване на първоначалното настройване."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poznámka: Výběr modelu pumpy určuje, jaké kroky pro nastavení bazálních dávek budou k dispozici. Svou skutečnou pumpu spáruješ až po dokončení úvodního nastavení."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bemærk: Valg af din pumpemodel bestemmer, hvilke trin for opsætning af din basal rater er tilgængelige. Du vil parre din faktiske pumpe efter endt onboarding proces."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hinweis: Die Auswahl Deines Pumpenmodells bestimmt, welche Schritte für die Einstellung Deiner Basalraten verfügbar sind. Du wirst Deine aktuelle Pumpe nach Abschluss des Einführungsprozesses koppeln."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Note: Choosing your pump model determines which increments for setting up your basal rates are available. You will pair your actual pump after finishing the onboarding process."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Remarque : Le choix de votre modèle de pompe détermine les incréments disponibles pour le réglage de votre profil basal. Vous associerez la pompe que vous utilisez à la fin du processus de configuration initiale."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Note: Choosing your pump model determines which increments for setting up your basal rates are available. You will pair your actual pump after finishing the onboarding process."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nota: La scelta del modello della pompa determina gli incrementi disponibili per la configurazione delle velocità basali. Collegherai la tua pompa dopo aver terminato il processo di Onboarding."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Note: Choosing your pump model determines which increments for setting up your basal rates are available. You will pair your actual pump after finishing the onboarding process."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Merk: Valg av pumpemodell bestemmer hvilke trinn som blir tilgjengelig for basalraten din, da dette varierer mellom de forskjellige pumpene. Tilkobling av selve pumpen skjer etter at veiledningen er ferdig."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Let op: het kiezen van je pomp model bepaalt welke stappen je kunt nemen om je basaalstanden in te stellen. Je zal je huidige pomp koppelen na het voltooien van het onboarding."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uwaga: Wybór modelu pompy określa, jaki skok podstawowej dawki bazowej jest dostępny. Sparujesz swoją rzeczywistą pompę po zakończeniu procesu wdrażania."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Note: Choosing your pump model determines which increments for setting up your basal rates are available. You will pair your actual pump after finishing the onboarding process."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Note: Choosing your pump model determines which increments for setting up your basal rates are available. You will pair your actual pump after finishing the onboarding process."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Note: Choosing your pump model determines which increments for setting up your basal rates are available. You will pair your actual pump after finishing the onboarding process."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Obs: Ditt val av pumpmodell här bestämmer också vilka minsta steg som dina basalvärden kan ställas in med. Du parkopplar sedan din riktiga pump efter att onboardingen är genomförd."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Note: Choosing your pump model determines which increments for setting up your basal rates are available. You will pair your actual pump after finishing the onboarding process."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Note: Choosing your pump model determines which increments for setting up your basal rates are available. You will pair your actual pump after finishing the onboarding process."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lưu ý: Kiểu máy bơm bạn chọn sẽ ảnh hưởng đến các mức điều chỉnh liều nền có thể thiết lập. Việc ghép nối với máy bơm thật sẽ được thực hiện sau khi bạn hoàn tất quy trình cài đặt ban đầu."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "注意：選擇您的幫浦型號會決定設定基礎率時可用的增量。在完成入門過程後，您將配對實際的幫浦。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Note: If this is enabled and the criteria are met, SMBs could be utilized regardless of other SMB settings being enabled or not." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Забележка: Ако това е включено и критериите са изпълнени, SMB може да се използват независимо дали другите настройки за SMB са включени или не."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poznámka: Pokud je tato volba povolena a jsou splněna kritéria, mohou být SMB využity bez ohledu na to, zda jsou ostatní nastavení SMB povolena či nikoli."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bemærk: Hvis dette er aktiveret og kriterierne er opfyldt, kan SMB'er udnyttes, uanset om andre SMB-indstillinger er aktiveret eller ej."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hinweis: Wenn diese Option aktiviert ist und die Kriterien erfüllt sind, können SMBs unabhängig von der Aktivierung anderer SMB-Einstellungen verwendet werden oder nicht."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nota: Si esto está activado y los criterios se cumplen, los SMS podrían ser utilizados independientemente de otras configuraciones SMB habilitadas o no."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Remarque : Si ce réglage est activé et que les critères sont remplis, des SMB peuvent être utilisés, que les autres réglages SMB soient activés ou pas."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Note: If this is enabled and the criteria are met, SMBs could be utilized regardless of other SMB settings being enabled or not."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nota: Se questo è abilitato e i criteri sono soddisfatti, le PMI potrebbero essere utilizzate indipendentemente da altre impostazioni SMB abilitate o meno."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Note: If this is enabled and the criteria are met, SMBs could be utilized regardless of other SMB settings being enabled or not."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Merk: Hvis dette er aktivert og kriteriene er oppfylt, kan SMB brukes uavhengig av om andre SMB-innstillinger er aktivert eller ikke."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Opmerking: als dit is ingeschakeld en aan de criteria is voldaan, kunnen SMB's worden gebruikt, ongeacht andere SMB instellingen die wel of niet zijn ingeschakeld."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uwaga: Jeśli ta opcja jest włączona i spełnione są kryteria, SMB może być używane niezależnie od innych ustawień SMB włączonych lub nie."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nota: Se isso estiver ativado e os critérios forem atendidos, SMBs podem ser utilizados independente de outras configurações de SMB estarem ativadas ou não."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Note: If this is enabled and the criteria are met, SMBs could be utilized regardless of other SMB settings being enabled or not."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Примечание: Если этот параметр и критерии выполнены, СМБ могут быть использованы независимо от того, какие другие настройки SMB включены или нет."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Obs: Om detta är aktiverat och kriterierna är uppfyllda kan SMB:s användas oavsett om andra SMB-inställningar är aktiverade eller inte."
