    "The settings in this section typically do not require ANY modifications. Do not alter them without a solid understanding of what you are changing and the full impact it will have on the algorithm." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Настройките в този раздел обикновено НЕ изискват НИКАКВИ промени. Не ги променяйте без солидно разбиране на какво променяте и пълното въздействие, което това ще има върху алгоритъма."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nastavení v této sekci obvykle nevyžadují ŽÁDNÉ úpravy. Neměň je bez důkladného pochopení toho, co měníš, a celkového dopadu, který to bude mít na algoritmus."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Indstillingerne i dette afsnit kræver typisk ingen ændringer. Du må ikke ændre dem uden en solid forståelse af, hvad du er ved at ændre og den fulde indvirkning det vil have på algoritmen."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Einstellungen in diesem Abschnitt müssen normalerweise NICHT geändert werden. Ändere sie nicht, ohne genau zu wissen, was Du änderst und welche Auswirkungen dies auf den Algorithmus hat."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los ajustes de esta sección normalmente no requieren ninguna modificación. No los altere sin una comprensión sólida de lo que está cambiando y del impacto total que tendrá en el algoritmo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les réglages de cette section ne nécessitent généralement aucune modification. N’y apportez aucun changement sans une compréhension approfondie de ce que vous modifiez et de l’impact que cela aura sur l’algorithme."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The settings in this section typically do not require ANY modifications. Do not alter them without a solid understanding of what you are changing and the full impact it will have on the algorithm."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le impostazioni di questa sezione in genere non richiedono alcuna modifica. Non modificarli senza una solida comprensione di ciò che stai cambiando e l'impatto completo che avrà sull'algoritmo."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
