    "This feature smooths your CGM readings to reduce noise and make them easier to read. It is based on a method used in AndroidAPS (AAPS). It uses two approaches: one that reacts quickly to recent changes, and one that looks at longer trends. These are combined to give a balanced result." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Тази функция изглажда показанията на CGM ви, за да намали шума и да ги направи по-лесни за четене. Тя се базира на метод, използван в AndroidAPS (AAPS). Използва два подхода: единият реагира бързо на скорошни промени, а другият проследява по-дълги тенденции. Те се комбинират, за да дадат балансиран резултат."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tato funkce vyhlazuje naměřené hodnoty z CGM, aby omezila šum a usnadnila jejich čtení. Vychází z metody používané v aplikaci AndroidAPS (AAPS). Využívá dva přístupy: jeden, který reaguje rychle na nedávné změny, a druhý, který sleduje dlouhodobější trendy. Tyto přístupy jsou kombinovány tak, aby poskytovaly vyvážený výsledek."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This feature smooths your CGM readings to reduce noise and make them easier to read. It is based on a method used in AndroidAPS (AAPS). It uses two approaches: one that reacts quickly to recent changes, and one that looks at longer trends. These are combined to give a balanced result."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
