    "Turning this on will show the grams of carbs needed to prevent a low as a notification badge on the Trio home screen located above the main icon.\n\nOnce enabled, set the Carbs Required Threshold to the lowest number of carbs you'd like to be recommended. A recommendation will not be given if carbs required is below this number.\n\nNote: The carbs suggested with this feature are to be used as a recommendation, not as a requirement. Depending on the current accuracy of your sensor and the accuracy of your settings, the suggested carbs can vary widely. Use your best judgement before injesting the suggested quanitity of carbs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Включването на това ще показва грамовете въглехидрати, необходими за предотвратяване на ниска, като значка за известия върху началния екран на Trio над основната икона.\n\nСлед активиране задайте прага за необходимите въглехидрати на най-малкия брой въглехидрати, който бихте искали да ви се препоръчва. Препоръка няма да се дава, ако необходимите въглехидрати са под това число.\n\nЗабележка: Въглехидратите, предлагани чрез тази функция, са препоръка, а не задължение. В зависимост от текущата точност на сензора и точността на настройките ви, предложените въглехидрати могат да варират значително. Преценете добре, преди да приемете предложеното количество въглехидрати."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zapnutím této funkce se počet gramů sacharidů potřebných k zabránění hypo zobrazí jako odznak oznámení na domovské obrazovce Tria nad hlavní ikonou.\n\nPo zapnutí nastav „Práh pro doporučení sacharidů“ na nejnižší počet sacharidů, který chceš mít doporučen. Pokud bude potřeba sacharidů nižší než toto číslo, doporučení se nezobrazí.\n\nPoznámka: Sacharidy navržené touto funkcí slouží pouze jako doporučení, nikoliv jako požadavek. V závislosti na aktuální přesnosti tvého senzoru a správnosti tvého nastavení se mohou navrhované sacharidy značně lišit. Před požitím navrženého množství sacharidů se řiď vlastním úsudkem."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hvis du slår dette til, vises grammet af kulhydrater, der er nødvendige for at forhindre en lav som et meddelelsesmærke på Trio-startskærmen placeret over hovedikonet.\n\nNår aktiveret, indstille kulhydrater kræves Tærskel til det laveste antal kulhydrater, du gerne vil blive anbefalet. Der vil ikke blive givet en anbefaling, hvis kulhydrater er under dette nummer.\n\nBemærk: De kulhydrater, der foreslås med denne funktion, skal bruges som en anbefaling, ikke som et krav. Afhængigt af den aktuelle nøjagtighed af din sensor og nøjagtigheden af dine indstillinger, kan de foreslåede kulhydrater variere meget. Brug din bedste dømmekraft, før du skader den foreslåede modstandsdygtighed over for kulstof."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn Du diese Funktion aktivierst, werden die Kohlenhydrate, die benötigt werden, um eine Unterzuckerung zu vermeiden, als Benachrichtigungssymbol auf dem Startbildschirm von Trio über dem Homescreen-Dymbol angezeigt.\n\nLege nach der Aktivierung den Schwellenwert für benötigte Kohlenhydrate auf die niedrigste Anzahl von Kohlenhydraten fest, die empfohlen werden soll. Es wird keine Empfehlung ausgesprochen, wenn die Anzahl der benötigten Kohlenhydrate unter diesem Wert liegt.\n\nHinweis: Die mit dieser Funktion vorgeschlagenen Kohlenhydrate sind als Empfehlung zu verstehen, nicht als ein \"Muss\". Je nach der aktuellen Genauigkeit Deines Sensors und der Genauigkeit Deiner Einstellungen können die vorgeschlagenen Kohlenhydrate stark variieren. Überlege gut, bevor Du die vorgeschlagene Menge an Kohlenhydraten zu Dir nimmst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turning this on will show the grams of carbs needed to prevent a low as a notification badge on the Trio home screen located above the main icon.\n\nOnce enabled, set the Carbs Required Threshold to the lowest number of carbs you'd like to be recommended. A recommendation will not be given if carbs required is below this number.\n\nNote: The carbs suggested with this feature are to be used as a recommendation, not as a requirement. Depending on the current accuracy of your sensor and the accuracy of your settings, the suggested carbs can vary widely. Use your best judgement before injesting the suggested quanitity of carbs."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Activer cette option affichera le nombre de grammes de glucides nécessaires pour éviter une hypoglycémie sous forme de pastille de notification dans la barre avec les boutons d'actions de Trio, au-dessus de l’icône \"Principal\" (📈).\n\nUne fois activée, fixez le seuil de glucides requis (en grammes) à partir duquel vous souhaitez recevoir cette recommandation. Si le besoin en glucides est inférieur à cette valeur, aucune recommandation ne sera affichée .\n\nRemarque : Les glucides suggérés via cette fonctionnalité sont des recommandations, pas des obligations. Selon la précision actuelle de votre capteur et la fiabilité de vos réglages, la quantité suggérée peut varier considérablement. Utilisez toujours votre bon sens avant d’ingérer la quantité de glucides recommandée."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turning this on will show the grams of carbs needed to prevent a low as a notification badge on the Trio home screen located above the main icon.\n\nOnce enabled, set the Carbs Required Threshold to the lowest number of carbs you'd like to be recommended. A recommendation will not be given if carbs required is below this number.\n\nNote: The carbs suggested with this feature are to be used as a recommendation, not as a requirement. Depending on the current accuracy of your sensor and the accuracy of your settings, the suggested carbs can vary widely. Use your best judgement before injesting the suggested quanitity of carbs."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Attivando questa opzione verranno visualizzati i grammi di carboidrati necessari per evitare un abbassamento come distintivo di notifica nella schermata Home del Trio situata sopra l'icona principale.\n\nUna volta abilitata, imposta la soglia richiesta per Carbs al numero più basso di carboidrati che vorresti essere raccomandato. Una raccomandazione non sarà data se i carboidrati richiesti sono al di sotto di questo numero.\n\nNota: i carboidrati suggeriti con questa funzione devono essere utilizzati come raccomandazione, non come requisito. A seconda della precisione attuale del sensore e della precisione delle impostazioni, i carboidrati suggeriti possono variare ampiamente. Utilizzare il vostro giudizio migliore prima di ferire la quanitity suggerita di carboidrati."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turning this on will show the grams of carbs needed to prevent a low as a notification badge on the Trio home screen located above the main icon.\n\nOnce enabled, set the Carbs Required Threshold to the lowest number of carbs you'd like to be recommended. A recommendation will not be given if carbs required is below this number.\n\nNote: The carbs suggested with this feature are to be used as a recommendation, not as a requirement. Depending on the current accuracy of your sensor and the accuracy of your settings, the suggested carbs can vary widely. Use your best judgement before injesting the suggested quanitity of carbs."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ved å aktivere denne funksjonen vil Trio vise antall gram karbohydrater som trengs for å unngå føling. Dette vil vises over hovedikonet på hjemskjermen.\n\nEtter aktivering, sett innstillingen \"Terskel for karbohydratbehov\" til det laveste antall karbohydrater du ønsker å få anbefalt. Det vil ikke bli gitt noen anbefaling dersom behovet er lavere enn det du setter i innstillingen.\n\nMerk: Anbefalingen skal brukes veiledende, ikke som en fasit. Anbefalingen kan variere stort med nøyaktigheten på din sensor og dine innstillinger. Bruk egen vurdering før du inntar karbohydrater i henhold til anbefalingen."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Door dit aan te zetten worden de grammen van koolhydraten weergegeven die nodig zijn om te voorkomen dat een lage als meldingsbadge op het startscherm van de Trio zich boven het hoofdpictogram bevinden.\n\nEenmaal ingeschakeld stel je de vereiste hoeveelheid koolhydraten in op het laagste aantal koolhydraten dat je zou willen aanbevelen. Een aanbeveling wordt niet gegeven als de vereiste koolhydraten onder dit nummer vallen.\n\nOpmerking: de koolhydraten die met deze functie worden voorgesteld, moeten worden gebruikt als een aanbeveling, niet als een vereiste. Afhankelijk van de huidige nauwkeurigheid van de sensor en de nauwkeurigheid van je instellingen, kunnen de voorgestelde koolhydraten sterk variëren. Gebruik je beste beoordeling voordat je de voorgestelde quanitiiteit van koolhydraten beschadigt."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Włączenie tej funkcji spowoduje wyświetlenie gramów węglowodanów potrzebnych do uniknięcia hipoglikemii jako odznaki powiadomienia na ekranie głównym Trio, znajdującej się nad główną ikoną.\n\nPo włączeniu ustaw próg wymaganych węglowodanów na najniższą liczbę węglowodanów, które chcesz zalecić. Zalecenie nie zostanie podane, jeśli wymagana liczba węglowodanów będzie niższa od tej liczby.\n\nUwaga: Węglowodany sugerowane przez tę funkcję mają być używane jako zalecenie, a nie jako wymóg. W zależności od bieżącej dokładności czujnika i dokładności ustawień sugerowane węglowodany mogą się znacznie różnić. Przed przyjęciem sugerowanej ilości węglowodanów należy kierować się własnym osądem."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ao ativá-la, você mostrará os gramas de carbs necessários para evitar um sinal de notificação baixo na tela do Trio Home, localizada acima do ícone principal.\n\nUma vez ativado, defina o limite necessário de carboidratos para o menor número de carbos que você gostaria de ser recomendado. Uma recomendação não será dada se os carbs necessários estiverem abaixo deste número.\n\nNota: Os hidratos sugeridos com essa funcionalidade devem ser usados como uma recomendação, não como um requisito. Dependendo da precisão atual do seu sensor e da precisão das suas configurações, os hidratos sugeridos podem variar largamente. Utilize seu melhor julgamento antes de injedificar a quanidade sugerida de carboidratos."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turning this on will show the grams of carbs needed to prevent a low as a notification badge on the Trio home screen located above the main icon.\n\nOnce enabled, set the Carbs Required Threshold to the lowest number of carbs you'd like to be recommended. A recommendation will not be given if carbs required is below this number.\n\nNote: The carbs suggested with this feature are to be used as a recommendation, not as a requirement. Depending on the current accuracy of your sensor and the accuracy of your settings, the suggested carbs can vary widely. Use your best judgement before injesting the suggested quanitity of carbs."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turning this on will show the grams of carbs needed to prevent a low as a notification badge on the Trio home screen located above the main icon.\n\nOnce enabled, set the Carbs Required Threshold to the lowest number of carbs you'd like to be recommended. A recommendation will not be given if carbs required is below this number.\n\nNote: The carbs suggested with this feature are to be used as a recommendation, not as a requirement. Depending on the current accuracy of your sensor and the accuracy of your settings, the suggested carbs can vary widely. Use your best judgement before injesting the suggested quanitity of carbs."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Genom att aktivera denna inställning visas antalet gram kolhydrater som behövs för att förhindra en låg glukosnivå som en notifieringssymbol på Trio-startskärmen, placerad ovanför hemikonen.\n\nNär funktionen är aktiverad, ställ in “Tröskelvärde för behov kolhydrater” till det lägsta antalet kolhydrater du vill få rekommenderat. En rekommendation ges inte om behovet understiger denna mängd.\n\nObs: De kolhydrater som föreslås med denna funktion är en rekommendation, inte ett krav. Beroende på sensorns aktuella noggrannhet och inställningarnas precision kan de föreslagna kolhydraterna variera kraftigt. Använd ditt omdöme innan du intar den föreslagna mängden kolhydrater."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turning this on will show the grams of carbs needed to prevent a low as a notification badge on the Trio home screen located above the main icon.\n\nOnce enabled, set the Carbs Required Threshold to the lowest number of carbs you'd like to be recommended. A recommendation will not be given if carbs required is below this number.\n\nNote: The carbs suggested with this feature are to be used as a recommendation, not as a requirement. Depending on the current accuracy of your sensor and the accuracy of your settings, the suggested carbs can vary widely. Use your best judgement before injesting the suggested quanitity of carbs."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turning this on will show the grams of carbs needed to prevent a low as a notification badge on the Trio home screen located above the main icon.\n\nOnce enabled, set the Carbs Required Threshold to the lowest number of carbs you'd like to be recommended. A recommendation will not be given if carbs required is below this number.\n\nNote: The carbs suggested with this feature are to be used as a recommendation, not as a requirement. Depending on the current accuracy of your sensor and the accuracy of your settings, the suggested carbs can vary widely. Use your best judgement before injesting the suggested quanitity of carbs."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bật tính năng này sẽ hiển thị số gam carbs cần thiết để ngăn ngừa hạ đường huyết dưới dạng biểu tượng thông báo (badge) trên màn hình chính của Trio, nằm phía trên biểu tượng chính.\n\nKhi đã bật, hãy đặt Ngưỡng Cần Carbs (Carbs Required Threshold) thành số gam thấp nhất mà bạn muốn hệ thống đề xuất. Sẽ không có khuyến nghị nào được đưa ra nếu lượng carbs cần thiết nằm dưới ngưỡng này.\n\nLưu ý: Lượng carbs được đề xuất từ tính năng này chỉ mang tính chất khuyến nghị, không phải bắt buộc. Tùy thuộc vào độ chính xác hiện tại của cảm biến đường huyết và độ chính xác trong các thiết lập của bạn, lượng carbs được đề xuất có thể thay đổi đáng kể. Hãy sử dụng phán đoán của bạn trước khi nạp lượng carbs được đề xuất."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "啟用這個功能後，將在 Trio 主畫面上的圖示上方顯示防止低血糖所需的碳水化合物克數作為通知標籤。\n\n啟用後，將碳水所需門檻值設為您希望推薦的碳水化合物的最低數量。如果所需碳水化合物低於此數量，則不會提供推薦。\n\n注意：使用此功能建議的碳水化合物數量僅供參考，並非必需。根據您傳感器的當前準確性和設定的準確性，建議的碳水化合物數量可能會有很大變化。請在攝入建議的碳水化合物數量前谨慎考量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
