    "Use the diagnostics-sharing chooser above. Pick \"Crash Reports Only\" to keep crash reporting but disable telemetry, or \"Disable Sharing\" to turn off both. Changes take effect immediately." : {

    },
    "Use your Tidepool credentials to log in. If you don't have a Tidepool account, you can sign up on the login page.\n\nWhen connected, Trio uploads your glucose, carb entries, insulin (bolus and basal), pump settings, and therapy settings to Tidepool.\n\nTherapy settings include basal schedules, carb ratios, insulin sensitivities, and glucose targets." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Use your Tidepool credentials to log in. If you don't have a Tidepool account, you can sign up on the login page.\n\nWhen connected, Trio uploads your glucose, carb entries, insulin (bolus and basal), pump settings, and therapy settings to Tidepool.\n\nTherapy settings include basal schedules, carb ratios, insulin sensitivities, and glucose targets."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pro přihlášení použij své přihlašovací údaje k Tidepoolu. Pokud účet u Tidepoolu ještě nemáš, můžeš se zaregistrovat na přihlašovací stránce.\n\nPo připojení bude Trio nahrávat tvou glukózu, záznamy sacharidů, inzulín (bolus i bazál), nastavení pumpy a nastavení léčby do Tidepoolu.\n\nNastavení léčby zahrnuje bazální rozvrhy, sacharidové poměry (CR), citlivost na inzulín (ISF) a cílové hodnoty glukózy."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Use your Tidepool credentials to log in. If you don't have a Tidepool account, you can sign up on the login page.\n\nWhen connected, Trio uploads your glucose, carb entries, insulin (bolus and basal), pump settings, and therapy settings to Tidepool.\n\nTherapy settings include basal schedules, carb ratios, insulin sensitivities, and glucose targets."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Use your Tidepool credentials to log in. If you don't have a Tidepool account, you can sign up on the login page.\n\nWhen connected, Trio uploads your glucose, carb entries, insulin (bolus and basal), pump settings, and therapy settings to Tidepool.\n\nTherapy settings include basal schedules, carb ratios, insulin sensitivities, and glucose targets."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Use your Tidepool credentials to log in. If you don't have a Tidepool account, you can sign up on the login page.\n\nWhen connected, Trio uploads your glucose, carb entries, insulin (bolus and basal), pump settings, and therapy settings to Tidepool.\n\nTherapy settings include basal schedules, carb ratios, insulin sensitivities, and glucose targets."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
