          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Use your Tidepool credentials to log in. If you don't have a Tidepool account, you can sign up on the login page.\n\nWhen connected, Trio uploads your glucose, carb entries, insulin (bolus and basal), pump settings, and therapy settings to Tidepool.\n\nTherapy settings include basal schedules, carb ratios, insulin sensitivities, and glucose targets."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請使用你的 Tidepool 憑證登入。若你還沒有 Tidepool 帳號，可以在登入頁面註冊。\n\n連線後，Trio 會將你的血糖、碳水輸入、胰島素（注射與基礎）、幫浦設定，以及治療設定上傳到 Tidepool。\n\n治療設定包含基礎時程、碳水化合物比率、胰島素敏感度，以及血糖目標。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
