    },
    "When this feature is enabled, manually setting a temporary target above %@ %@ will decrease the Autosens Ratio used for ISF and basal adjustments, resulting in less insulin delivered overall. This scales with the temporary target set; the higher the temp target, the lower the Autosens Ratio used." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Когато тази функция е активирана, ръчното задаване на временна цел над %@ %@ ще намали коефициента на Autosens, използван за корекции на ISF и базала, което ще доведе до по-малко подаван инсулин общо. Това се мащабира спрямо зададената временна цел; колкото по-висока е временната цел, толкова по-нисък е използваният коефициент на Autosens."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Když je tato funkce zapnutá, manuální nastavení dočasného cíle nad %1$@ %2$@ sníží poměr Autosens používaný pro úpravy ISF a bazálu, což vede k celkovému snížení množství podaného inzulínu. Toto se mění podle nastaveného dočasného cíle; čím vyšší je dočasný cíl, tím nižší je použitý poměr Autosens."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Når denne funktion er aktiveret, manuelt at indstille et midlertidigt mål over %1$@ %2$@ vil reducere Autosens Ratio, der bruges til ISF og basal justeringer, hvilket resulterer i mindre samlet afgivelse af insulin. Dette skalerer med det midlertidige målsæt; jo højere temp målet, desto lavere bruger Autosens forholdet."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn diese Funktion aktiviert ist, wird durch die manuelle Einstellung eines Temporären Ziels über %1$@ %2$@ das für ISF- und Basalanpassungen verwendete Autosens-Verhältnis verringert, was zu einer geringeren Insulinabgabe insgesamt führt. Dies ist proportional zum eingestellten Temporären Ziel; je höher das Temporäre Ziel, desto niedriger die verwendete Autosens Ratio."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When this feature is enabled, manually setting a temporary target above %1$@ %2$@ will decrease the Autosens Ratio used for ISF and basal adjustments, resulting in less insulin delivered overall. This scales with the temporary target set; the higher the temp target, the lower the Autosens Ratio used."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando esta característica está activada, establecer manualmente un objetivo temporal por encima de %1$@ %2$@ reducirá la Ratio de Autosens usada para ISF y ajustes basales, resultando en menos insulina entregada en general. Esta escala se ajusta al conjunto de objetivos temporales; cuanto más alto sea el objetivo temporal, menor será la relación de Autosens utilizada."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lorsque cette fonctionnalité est activée, définir manuellement une Cible Temporaire au-dessus de %1$@ %2$@ réduit le Ratio Autosens utilisé pour les ajustements du facteur de sensibilité à l’insuline (ISF) et du basal, ce qui entraîne une diminution globale de l’insuline administrée. Cet effet est proportionnel à la valeur de la cible : plus la Cible Temporaire est haute, plus la sensibilité du ration \"Ratio Autosens\" appliqué sera faible."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When this feature is enabled, manually setting a temporary target above %1$@ %2$@ will decrease the Autosens Ratio used for ISF and basal adjustments, resulting in less insulin delivered overall. This scales with the temporary target set; the higher the temp target, the lower the Autosens Ratio used."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quando questa funzione è abilitata, impostando manualmente un obiettivo temporaneo sopra %1$@ %2$@ diminuirà il rapporto Autosens utilizzato per ISF e le regolazioni basali, con conseguente minore quantità di insulina erogata complessivamente. Questa scala con l'obiettivo temporaneo impostato; maggiore è il target temporale, minore è il rapporto Autosens utilizzato."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When this feature is enabled, manually setting a temporary target above %1$@ %2$@ will decrease the Autosens Ratio used for ISF and basal adjustments, resulting in less insulin delivered overall. This scales with the temporary target set; the higher the temp target, the lower the Autosens Ratio used."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Når denne funksjonen er aktivert, vil et manuelt midlertidig mål over %1$@ %2$@ redusere Autosens ratio som brukes for ISF og basal-justeringer, noe som gir mindre total insulinleveranse. Denne skalerer med det midlertidige målet; jo høyere midlertidig mål, jo lavere Autosens ratio."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wanneer deze functie is ingeschakeld Handmatig een tijdelijk streefdoel instellen boven %1$@ %2$@ zal de Autosens verhouding verlagen die gebruikt wordt voor ISF en basale aanpassingen, leidt tot minder insuline in zijn totaliteit. Deze schaal met het tijdelijke streefdoel; hoe hoger het streefdoel, hoe lager de Autosens Verhouding wordt gebruikt."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gdy ta funkcja jest włączona, ręczne ustawienie celu tymczasowego powyżej %1$@ %2$@ zmniejszy współczynnik Autosens używany do regulacji ISF i bazy prowadzące do całkowitego zmniejszenia ilości insuliny. Skaluje się z tymczasowym ustawieniem docelowym; im wyższy cel tymczasowy, tym niższy współczynnik Autosens użyty."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quando este recurso está ativado, definir manualmente um alvo temporário acima de %1$@ %2$@ irá diminuir a relação de Autosens usada para ajustes de ISF e basal, resultando em menos insulina entregue no total. Isso escala com o alvo temporário; quanto maior o alvo temporário, menor a proporção de Autosens usada."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When this feature is enabled, manually setting a temporary target above %1$@ %2$@ will decrease the Autosens Ratio used for ISF and basal adjustments, resulting in less insulin delivered overall. This scales with the temporary target set; the higher the temp target, the lower the Autosens Ratio used."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Когда эта функция включена, вручную установите временную цель выше %1$@ %2$@ уменьшит соотношение автокомпонентов, используемое для настройки ISF и базы, В результате количество инсулина, доставленного в целом меньше. Это масштабирует с временной целью, чем выше темп, тем ниже используемое отношение автосменов."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "När denna funktion är aktiverad, och ett tillfälligt mål över %1$@ %2$@ aktiveras, kommer Autosens-ration som används för ISF och basaljusteringar att minska, vilket resulterar i att mindre insulin levereras. Detta anpassas utifrån det aktuella tillfälliga målet: ju högre tillfälligt mål, desto lägre Autosens-ratio."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When this feature is enabled, manually setting a temporary target above %1$@ %2$@ will decrease the Autosens Ratio used for ISF and basal adjustments, resulting in less insulin delivered overall. This scales with the temporary target set; the higher the temp target, the lower the Autosens Ratio used."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Коли цю функцію ввімкнено, вручну настроїти тимчасову ціль над %1$@ %2$@ зменшить співвідношення автозапуску, що використовується для коригування в ISF і базових операціях, в результаті чого в цілому менше інсуліну. Ця шкала з тимчасовою ціллю набору; чим вище ціль храму, тим нижня частина автоматів використовувалась."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Khi tính năng này được bật, việc bạn tự đặt một Mục tiêu Tạm thời (Temp Target) cao hơn %1$@ %2$@ sẽ làm giảm Tỷ lệ Autosens được sử dụng để điều chỉnh ISF và liều nền, dẫn đến tổng lượng insulin được đưa vào cơ thể ít hơn. Mức giảm này sẽ tỷ lệ với giá trị mục tiêu tạm thời; mục tiêu tạm thời càng cao, Tỉ lệ Autosens được sử dụng càng thấp."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當啟用此功能時，手動設置臨時目標高於％1$@％2$@將降低用於ISF和基礎調整的自動敏感度比例，導致總體上輸送的胰島素減少。這將隨著設置的臨時目標的變高而變化；臨時目標越高，自動敏感度比例越低。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When this feature is enabled, setting a temporary target below %@ %@ will increase the Autosens Ratio used for ISF and basal adjustments, resulting in more insulin delivered overall. This scales with the temporary target set; the lower the Temp Target, the higher the Autosens Ratio used. It requires Algorithm Settings > Autosens > Autosens Max to be set to > 100%% to work." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Когато тази функция е активирана, задаването на временна цел под %@ %@ ще увеличи коефициента на Autosens, използван за корекции на ISF и базала, което ще доведе до повече подаван инсулин общо. Това се мащабира спрямо зададената временна цел; колкото по-ниска е временната цел, толкова по-висок е използваният коефициент на Autosens. Изисква Algorithm Settings > Autosens > Autosens Max да бъде зададено > 100%%, за да работи."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Když je tato funkce zapnutá, nastavení dočasného cíle pod %1$@ %2$@ zvýší poměr Autosens používaný pro úpravy ISF a bazálu, což povede k celkovému zvýšení množství podaného inzulínu. Toto se mění podle nastaveného dočasného cíle; čím nižší je dočasný cíl, tím vyšší je použitý poměr Autosens. Aby tato funkce fungovala, vyžaduje nastavení v sekci Nastavení algoritmu > Autosens > Autosens Max na hodnotu > 100 %%."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Når denne funktion er aktiveret, vil det at sætte et midlertidigt mål under %1$@ %2$@ øge Autosens Ratio, der anvendes til ISF og basale justeringer, hvilket resulterer i mere indgivet insulin generelt. Dette skalerer med det midlertidige målsæt; jo lavere Temp Target, desto højere er Autosens Ratio anvendt. Det kræver Algoritmeindstillinger > Autosens > Autosens Max skal indstilles til > 100%% for at virke."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn diese Funktion aktiviert ist, erhöht die Einstellung eines Temporären Ziels unter %1$@ %2$@ das für ISF- und Basalanpassungen verwendete Autosens-Verhältnis, was zu einer insgesamt höheren Insulinabgabe führt. Dies ist proportional zum eingestellten Temporären Ziel; je niedriger das Temporäre Ziel, desto höher die verwendete Autosens Ratio. Hierfür muss Algorithmuseinstellungen > Autosens > Autosens Max auf > 100%% eingestellt sein."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When this feature is enabled, setting a temporary target below %1$@ %2$@ will increase the Autosens Ratio used for ISF and basal adjustments, resulting in more insulin delivered overall. This scales with the temporary target set; the lower the Temp Target, the higher the Autosens Ratio used. It requires Algorithm Settings > Autosens > Autosens Max to be set to > 100%% to work."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When this feature is enabled, setting a temporary target below %1$@ %2$@ will increase the Autosens Ratio used for ISF and basal adjustments, resulting in more insulin delivered overall. This scales with the temporary target set; the lower the Temp Target, the higher the Autosens Ratio used. It requires Algorithm Settings > Autosens > Autosens Max to be set to > 100%% to work."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lorsque cette fonctionnalité est activée, définir une cible temporaire en dessous de %1$@ %2$@ augmentera la sensibilité automatique du ratio \"ratio Autosens\" utilisé pour l’ajustement de l'ISF et du débit basal, entraînant une administration d’insuline plus importante. Cette augmentation est proportionnelle à la cible temporaire définie : plus la cible temporaire est basse, plus le ratio Autosens est élevé.\n\nCette fonctionnalité nécessite que le réglage de la sensibilité automatique dans : « ⚙️Réglages > Algorithme > Autosens > Autosens max. » ait une valeur supérieure à 100 %% pour fonctionner."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When this feature is enabled, setting a temporary target below %1$@ %2$@ will increase the Autosens Ratio used for ISF and basal adjustments, resulting in more insulin delivered overall. This scales with the temporary target set; the lower the Temp Target, the higher the Autosens Ratio used. It requires Algorithm Settings > Autosens > Autosens Max to be set to > 100%% to work."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When this feature is enabled, setting a temporary target below %1$@ %2$@ will increase the Autosens Ratio used for ISF and basal adjustments, resulting in more insulin delivered overall. This scales with the temporary target set; the lower the Temp Target, the higher the Autosens Ratio used. It requires Algorithm Settings > Autosens > Autosens Max to be set to > 100%% to work."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When this feature is enabled, setting a temporary target below %1$@ %2$@ will increase the Autosens Ratio used for ISF and basal adjustments, resulting in more insulin delivered overall. This scales with the temporary target set; the lower the Temp Target, the higher the Autosens Ratio used. It requires Algorithm Settings > Autosens > Autosens Max to be set to > 100%% to work."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Når denne funksjonen er aktivert, vil det å sette et midlertidig mål under %1$@ %2$@ øke Autosens-forholdet som brukes til ISF- og basaljusteringer, noe som resulterer i mer insulin som tilføres totalt. Dette skaleres med det midlertidige målet som er satt; jo lavere det midlertidige målet er, desto høyere er Autosens-forholdet som brukes. Det krever at Algoritmeinnstillinger > Autosens > Autosens Max er satt til > 100 %% for at det skal fungere."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als deze functie aanstaat, zorgt het instellen van een tijdelijke doelwaarde lager dan %1$@ %2$@ ervoor dat de Autosens-verhouding omhoog gaat. Daardoor past het systeem de insulinegevoeligheid (ISF) en de basale insuline aan, wat betekent dat je uiteindelijk meer insuline krijgt. Hoe lager je de tijdelijke doelwaarde instelt, hoe hoger de Autosens-verhouding wordt. Let op: dit werkt alleen als je bij Algoritme-instellingen > Autosens > Autosens Max een waarde boven de 100%% hebt ingesteld."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gdy ta funkcja jest włączona, ustawienie tymczasowego celu poniżej %1$@ %2$@ zwiększy współczynnik Autosens używany do regulacji ISF i dawki podstawowej, co spowoduje dostarczenie większej ilości insuliny. Jest to skalowalne w zależności od ustawionego tymczasowego celu; im niższy cel tymczasowy, tym wyższy współczynnik Autosens. Wymaga ustawienia Algorithm Settings > Autosens > Autosens Max na > 100%%, aby działało."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When this feature is enabled, setting a temporary target below %1$@ %2$@ will increase the Autosens Ratio used for ISF and basal adjustments, resulting in more insulin delivered overall. This scales with the temporary target set; the lower the Temp Target, the higher the Autosens Ratio used. It requires Algorithm Settings > Autosens > Autosens Max to be set to > 100%% to work."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When this feature is enabled, setting a temporary target below %1$@ %2$@ will increase the Autosens Ratio used for ISF and basal adjustments, resulting in more insulin delivered overall. This scales with the temporary target set; the lower the Temp Target, the higher the Autosens Ratio used. It requires Algorithm Settings > Autosens > Autosens Max to be set to > 100%% to work."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When this feature is enabled, setting a temporary target below %1$@ %2$@ will increase the Autosens Ratio used for ISF and basal adjustments, resulting in more insulin delivered overall. This scales with the temporary target set; the lower the Temp Target, the higher the Autosens Ratio used. It requires Algorithm Settings > Autosens > Autosens Max to be set to > 100%% to work."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "När denna funktion är aktiverad, och ett tillfälligt mål under %1$@ %2$@ aktiveras, kommer Autosens-ration som används för ISF och basaljusteringar att öka, vilket resulterar i att mer insulin levereras. Detta anpassas utifrån det aktuella tillfälliga målet: ju lägre tillfälligt mål, desto högre Autosens-ratio. En förutsättning för att detta ska fungera är att 'Algoritm > Autosens > Autosens maxinställning är inställd till ett värde högre än 100%%."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When this feature is enabled, setting a temporary target below %1$@ %2$@ will increase the Autosens Ratio used for ISF and basal adjustments, resulting in more insulin delivered overall. This scales with the temporary target set; the lower the Temp Target, the higher the Autosens Ratio used. It requires Algorithm Settings > Autosens > Autosens Max to be set to > 100%% to work."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When this feature is enabled, setting a temporary target below %1$@ %2$@ will increase the Autosens Ratio used for ISF and basal adjustments, resulting in more insulin delivered overall. This scales with the temporary target set; the lower the Temp Target, the higher the Autosens Ratio used. It requires Algorithm Settings > Autosens > Autosens Max to be set to > 100%% to work."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Khi bật tính năng này, việc đặt mục tiêu tạm thời thấp hơn %1$@ %2$@ sẽ làm tăng Autosens Ratio được dùng để điều chỉnh ISF và liều nền, dẫn đến tổng lượng insulin được đưa vào nhiều hơn. Mức tăng này sẽ thay đổi theo mục tiêu tạm thời đã đặt; mục tiêu tạm thời càng thấp thì tỷ lệ Autosens được sử dụng càng cao. Để tính năng này hoạt động, cần vào Cài đặt thuật toán > Autosens > Autosens Tối đa lớn hơn 100%%."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當此功能啟用時，將臨時目標設置在 %1$@ %2$@ 以下將提高用於ISF和基礎調整的自動敏感度比例，從而導致輸送更多胰島素。這與設定的臨時目標值成正比；臨時目標越低，使用的自動敏感度比例越高。要使其正常運行，需要將算法設定 > 自動敏感度 > 自動敏感度最大值設置為 > 100%%。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
